  "verseCount": 28,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "46",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 46"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "46",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "which came to Jeremiah the prophet against the Gentiles;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Against Egypt, against the army of Pharaoh-necho king of Egypt, which was by the river Euphrates in Carchemish, which Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon smote in the fourth year of Jehoiakim the son of Josiah king of Judah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Order ye the buckler and shield, and draw near to battle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Harness the horses; and get up, ye horsemen, and stand forth with",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "your",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "helmets; furbish the spears,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "put on the brigandines.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wherefore have I seen them dismayed",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "turned away back? and their mighty ones are beaten down, and are fled apace, and look not back:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "fear",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "round about, saith the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Let not the swift flee away, nor the mighty man escape; they shall stumble, and fall toward the north by the river Euphrates.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Who",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "cometh up as a flood, whose waters are moved as the rivers?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egypt riseth up like a flood, and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "his",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "waters are moved like the rivers; and he saith, I will go up,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will cover the earth; I will destroy the city and the inhabitants thereof.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Come up, ye horses; and rage, ye chariots; and let the mighty men come forth; the Ethiopians and the Libyans, that handle the shield; and the Lydians, that handle",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bend the bow.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the day of the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts, a day of vengeance, that he may avenge him of his adversaries: and the sword shall devour, and it shall be satiate and made drunk with their blood: for the Lord",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "GOD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of hosts hath a sacrifice in the north country by the river Euphrates.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go up into Gilead, and take balm, O virgin, the daughter of Egypt: in vain shalt thou use many medicines;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "for",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thou shalt not be cured.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The nations have heard of thy shame, and thy cry hath filled the land: for the mighty man hath stumbled against the mighty,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they are fallen both together.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ The word that the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "spake to Jeremiah the prophet, how Nebuchadrezzar king of Babylon should come",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "smite the land of Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Declare ye in Egypt, and publish in Migdol, and publish in Noph and in Tahpanhes: say ye, Stand fast, and prepare thee; for the sword shall devour round about thee.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Why are thy valiant",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "men",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "swept away? they stood not, because the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.46.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.46.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "did drive them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.46.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.46.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 46:16"
